# Planning + early scaffold

This repository is primarily in **planning mode**. Full Project / Node / Parameter
domain model is still being designed.

## Allowed now

- Update plans under `docs/plans/`
- Update living docs (`docs/PRODUCT.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`, `README.md`)
- Update Cursor rules that guide planning, standards, or documentation sync
- Record decisions, open questions, acceptance criteria, and non-goals
- Standalone disposable UI sketches under `prototypes/`
- **Early plugin scaffold** (`wp-taxonomy-tree.php`, `includes/`, admin tree UI)
  when the user **explicitly** asks to see/build a runnable preview
- Version starts at **`0.0.1`** (see `versioning.mdc`)

## Scaffold scope (allowed)

- Taxonomy-agnostic tree browse / create / select / delete (MVP FR1–FR7 slice)
- Thin admin UI over WordPress terms (no custom tables yet)
- Placeholder for later Project/Node/Parameter domain services

## Not allowed yet (without further explicit ask)

- Full BOM / Composition / Parameter domain implementation
- Treating the scaffold as planning sign-off for the whole model
- Wiring `prototypes/` static HTML into production plugin code

## Full implementation exit

Broader domain coding beyond the taxonomy-tree scaffold continues when:

1. `docs/plans/project-plan.md` status leaves `planning` / `scaffolding` toward a ready state, and
2. The user asks to implement the next slice.
